---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro"
import { getLangFromUrl, useTranslations, useTranslatedPath } from "../../i18n/ui"
const lang = getLangFromUrl(Astro.url)
const t = useTranslations(lang)
const impressumPath = useTranslatedPath(lang)("/impressum/")
---

<BaseLayout title={t("privacy.title")}>
  <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-4">{t("privacy.title")}</h1>

  <p class="mb-6 leading-relaxed text-sm text-base-content/80">
    This website sets no cookies for analytics, marketing or statistics and uses no tracking tools.
    Only data that is technically necessary to operate the site and answer enquiries is processed.
  </p>

  <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold mt-8 mb-2">Controller</h2>
  <p class="mb-6 leading-relaxed text-sm text-base-content/80">
    Christoph Kröppl. Name, postal address and email address are listed in the{" "}
    <a class="link link-hover" href={impressumPath}>
      legal notice
    </a>
    .
  </p>

  <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold mt-8 mb-2">Hosting</h2>
  <p class="mb-6 leading-relaxed text-sm text-base-content/80">
    This website runs as a Cloudflare Worker at Cloudflare, Inc., 101 Townsend St, San Francisco, CA
    94107, USA. When the site is accessed, Cloudflare processes technically necessary connection
    data such as IP address, time of access, requested resource and user agent in server logs. The
    legal basis is the legitimate interest in secure and stable operation under Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR. A
    data processing agreement is in place with Cloudflare; transfers to the United States rely on
    the EU-US Data Privacy Framework.
  </p>

  <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold mt-8 mb-2">Contact form and Turnstile</h2>
  <p class="mb-6 leading-relaxed text-sm text-base-content/80">
    To prevent automated submissions, the contact form is protected by Cloudflare Turnstile.
    Turnstile processes client signals such as IP address, TLS fingerprint, user agent, and the
    sitekey and origin used. Turnstile sets no cookies on this website; pre-clearance is not
    enabled. Cloudflare acts as a processor for bot detection and as an independent controller when
    improving its own detection methods. The legal basis is the legitimate interest in preventing
    abuse under Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR.
  </p>

  <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold mt-8 mb-2">Delivery of contact requests</h2>
  <p class="mb-6 leading-relaxed text-sm text-base-content/80">
    The details entered in the form (name, email address, phone number, message) are transmitted via
    the Telegram Bot API to Telegram Messenger Inc. and stored there so the enquiry can be handled.
    The legal basis is the performance of your request under Art. 6(1)(b) GDPR and the legitimate
    interest in reliable delivery under Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR. Telegram carries out its own data
    processing for delivery; Telegram's privacy policy applies additionally. Enquiries are deleted
    once they have been fully handled and no statutory retention obligations apply.
  </p>

  <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold mt-8 mb-2">Contact details on this website</h2>
  <p class="mb-6 leading-relaxed text-sm text-base-content/80">
    The postal address, email address and phone number are not shipped with the page source. They
    are requested from the server only after a click and rendered as graphics. That request is not
    stored, sets no cookies and involves no third parties.
  </p>

  <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold mt-8 mb-2">Your rights</h2>
  <p class="mb-6 leading-relaxed text-sm text-base-content/80">
    You have the right to access, rectification, erasure, restriction of processing, data
    portability and objection to processing (Art. 15 to 21 GDPR). You may also lodge a complaint
    with the Austrian Data Protection Authority:{" "}
    <a
      class="link link-hover"
      href="https://www.dsb.gv.at"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
    >
      Barichgasse 40–42, 1030 Vienna (dsb.gv.at)
    </a>
    .
  </p>

  <p class="mt-8 text-xs text-base-content/60">Last updated: November 2026</p>
</BaseLayout>
